    Workaround for buggy timestamps

    The feed used from MetaCPAN can be buggy when large numbers of
    uploads occur. The timestamp becomes inaccurate and multiple reports
    can happen.

    Implemented a cache of AUTHOR/DIST that we have seen previously so as
    not to send duplicates. 

